   "source": [
    "## **I. Introduction**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "97cdebf1-b242-4ab9-b796-001dbb95e658",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The following Exploratory Data Analysis(EDA) is based on the file \" Wages\", wherein we shall provide data analysis of the available data set through the means of Python. The file contains data about the wages earned by the people. the file is further bifurcated into various variables such as Married, Years in education, Gender etc. The aim is to : \n",
    "\n",
    "* Summarise the main features of the data using descriptive statistics.\n",
    "* Explore the relationships between key variables visually and statistically.\n",
    "* Test hypotheses about differences in wages across different groups.\n",
    "* Build and interpret a linear regression model for wage prediction."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9a8e70e1-53bb-4d1d-9ce4-fb95322141f4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
