   "source": [
    "## **IX. Linear Regression Analysis**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "79696156-c8fd-47ed-ac05-7dfb92e80a35",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We lastly fit a multiple linear regression model to predict variation in hourly wages based on a number of predictors:\n",
    "\n",
    "* years_in_education\n",
    "* years_in_employment\n",
    "* married\n",
    "* gender\n",
    "\n",
    "We are going to estimate this model using OLS:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$HourlyWage = \\beta_0 \n",
    "+ \\beta_1 \\cdot \\text{years\\_in\\_education}\n",
    "+ \\beta_2 \\cdot \\text{years\\_in\\_employment}\n",
    "+ \\beta_3 \\cdot \\text{married}\n",
    "+ \\beta_4 \\cdot \\text{gender}_{male}\n",
    "+ \\varepsilon\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
